{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overtech AI earphone rhythm game that saves your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861800/extras/1e19b1c0600f4293cac71b3ccabd5ddd.avif?t=1769646225\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, &quot;Milo&quot; is chosen as a closed beta tester for the latest earbuds, &quot;APods.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With AI that generates songs based on the wearer\u2019s emotions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the &quot;APods&quot; captivate &quot;Milo,&quot; leading him to finally decide to confess to &quot;Sierra&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861800/extras/9cf131f0852ac62ded520ee7a051c78e.avif?t=1769646225\" width=1240 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rhythm game and its controls are very standard (ESC, Space Bar, Enter, Arrow Keys). However, for directional input or movement, we recommend placing your index fingers on the F and J keys for left and right, respectively. (This helps synchronize the sense of direction between your hands and ears.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861800/extras/9fc1114fd791e3858bc391b5e3e8ddb6.avif?t=1769646225\" width=1180 height=425 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Early Access) The game is composed of 4 chapters, with 3-4 episodes per chapter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter is an omnibus-style story centered around a different character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode features a single rhythm game track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack for each chapter is composed of genres that align with the main character's preferences.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 1</strong>: <span class=\"bb_strike\">EDM</span> Rock </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 2</strong>: <span class=\"bb_strike\">Rock</span> EDM </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 3</strong>: Hip-hop </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 4</strong>: J-POP </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 5</strong>: Epic Orchestral</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slice-of-life youth drama that uses a wireless earphone with &quot;Noise Canceling&quot; as its central theme. Experience realistic soundscapes as if you were actually wearing wireless earphones and using features like &quot;Noise Canceling.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Firmware\u00a0Upgrade\u00a0Complete</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your APods have been upgraded to 99.b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hello!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your APods are currently running the &quot;Closed Beta&quot; firmware. Performance may be unstable, and unexpected bugs may occur frequently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New features in this version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >APods now recognize the wearer's emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiri generates and plays songs in real time to match the wearer's emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Currently Reported Issues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Noise Canceling and Ambient Sound modes may switch on and off intermittently depending on the wearer's emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. The more intense the wearer's emotions, the more frequently problems may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Depending on the wearer's emotional range, the audio range may narrow or widen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. As the wearer's focus decreases, more power is consumed for emotion recognition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. If emotional deficiency is detected from the wearer, the connection may temporarily become unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try it now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap &quot;F&quot; and &quot;J&quot; to the rhythm of the music playing in both ears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the wonder of music that moves hearts and brings salvation.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 1 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/779983f860b2327fd9198c896de2868fa0d7177f.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/1efa92bcb1ddda3e4d15a42c6a950016b63df627.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 3 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/da00218adacfe5f4de5be920f0f3903b33a5cc06.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 4 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/98fcbd8d1f7fd3affdcac4ec99914e8ce5e98b8d.jpg"},{"name":"First S Rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/fea3be64265de8d3496f911a7573cc131f62c35a.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Immersion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/d218a1f7c64e6dcde80d63618355fac2ef6bd654.jpg"},{"name":"Favorite Song","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/4f635d9af9687de78057808737be3e67603e7785.jpg"},{"name":"Noise Canceler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/8a348b4245d0119e05a10a0ca1b49f82dc357aef.jpg"},{"name":"Overcurrent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/0b2dd46aa6956c0a992adb42baf5f21dd68aa8cb.jpg"},{"name":"A Part of Your Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861800/1a0cec5edb26a5cd87489b98497a5a6f689387df.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861800?t=1769646225","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861800?t=1769646225","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861800/7d1d32bd5859f6bee5ffdd41c2b6149dda376623/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769646225","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861800/7d1d32bd5859f6bee5ffdd41c2b6149dda376623/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769646225","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3927970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overtech AI earphone rhythm game that saves your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861800/extras/1e19b1c0600f4293cac71b3ccabd5ddd.avif?t=1769646225\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, &quot;Milo&quot; is chosen as a closed beta tester for the latest earbuds, &quot;APods.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 