agraph\" ><strong>Chapter 3</strong>: Hip-hop </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 4</strong>: J-POP </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 5</strong>: Epic Orchestral</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slice-of-life youth drama that uses a wireless earphone with &quot;Noise Canceling&quot; as its central theme. Experience realistic soundscapes as if you were actually wearing wireless earphones and using features like &quot;Noise Canceling.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Firmware\u00a0Upgrade\u00a0Complete</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your APods have been upgraded to 99.b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hello!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your APods are currently running the &quot;Closed Beta&quot; firmware. Performance may be unstable, and unexpected bugs may occur frequently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New features in this version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >APods now recognize the wearer's emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shiri generates and plays songs in real time to match the wearer's emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Currently Reported Issues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Noise Canceling and Ambient Sound modes may switch on and off intermittently depending on the wearer's emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. The more intense the wearer's emotions, the more frequently problems may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Depending on the wearer's emotional range, the audio range may narrow or widen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. As the wearer's focus decreases, more power is consumed for emotion recognition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. If emotional deficiency is detected from the wearer, the connection may temporarily become unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try it now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap &quot;F&quot; and &quot;J&quot; to the rhythm of the music playing in both ears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the wonder of music that moves hearts and brings salvation.</p>","developers":["MandU"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861800/ef8d38aed93978155dd99e27edb24f51c03c6b05/header.jpg?t=1769646225","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861800/773202880/7949815c841e6686dbf2eb725949de0965cf76b4/1758955617/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759924620","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861800/773202880/7949815c841e6686dbf2eb725949de0965cf76b4/1758955617/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759924620","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861800/773202880/7949815c841e6686dbf2eb725949de0965cf76b4/1758955617/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759924620","id":257207290,"name":"\ud140\ube14\ubc85 \ud2b8\ub808\uc77c\ub7ec","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207290/cc1f55380aec9ffc1c335d3e962482ce9f5c7494/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759924620"}],"name":"Noise Canceler","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Noise Canceler - $5.99 USD","packageid":1357737,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":599}],"title":"Buy Noise Canceler"}],"packages":[1357737],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb